1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Welcome to the beam backflip tutorial for beginners today.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
First we warm up the ankles and shoulders slowly.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Now the mount: step up, eyes forward, arms steady.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Spring off two feet and spot the landing early.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The landing is where most beginners fall apart.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Bend the knees deep and absorb every bit of force.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Finally the full routine linked together cleanly.

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Practice three times a week and film every attempt.
